	(text "strobe's best published low is 0.87 V and LVC541A's V_IL max is 0.8 V. It MISSES"
		(at 379.73 234.95 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "25af4817-a5c6-40b4-9151-a0f05986f55f")
	)
	(text "BY 70 mV, silently -- the buffer may simply never see a valid low on a signal that"
		(at 379.73 240.02999999999997 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "1ec5c2c1-e341-4aae-b7a6-41dfc82f9716")
	)
	(text "looks perfectly correct on a scope. A comparator is the only option whose margin"
		(at 379.73 245.10999999999999 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "3e4df8cb-00ec-45b1-bcbe-a8fe8888a2f8")
	)
	(text "is a design choice rather than a datasheet coincidence."
		(at 379.73 250.19 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "33e849ea-c506-4b70-9b58-1cd11f50c194")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 379.73 255.26999999999998 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "26decdc1-3dfd-4998-bb59-ea3a6b0ef2f0")
	)
	(text "WHY V+ = +12V AND NOT +5V: the LM339's input common-mode ceiling is V+ - 1.5V to"
		(at 379.73 260.34999999999997 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "4c01d04a-a6fc-4cd0-ab6f-b2a502d840ac")
	)
	(text "V+ - 2.0V. The strobe's HIGH is 5.0 V (pulled up to +5V through 1k, FLIR's own"
		(at 379.73 265.43 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "7989ba16-b8a9-4eae-b178-dfe413017a2f")
	)
	(text "published row: 0.87 V low / 5.0 V high / 4.2 mA). On +5V the ceiling is 3.0-3.5 V"
		(at 379.73 270.51 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "455642dd-fbcf-4750-a5f9-427881b22c4d")
	)
	(text "and a 5.0 V input sits ABOVE it -- the LM339's best-known failure mode, an"
		(at 379.73 275.59 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "00d7ae3a-c7e6-4864-9a8b-8b8dd96aa736")
	)
	(text "inverted output. +12V puts the ceiling at 10.0 V. Same rail U54 already runs."
		(at 379.73 280.66999999999996 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "92a138ce-be29-40da-8d69-8b55224c3f56")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 379.73 285.75 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "85a2ac58-dbdc-4b39-af84-90b1a4ea676c")
	)
	(text "WHY THE FRONT END IS DGND WHILE V- IS AGND -- NOT A CONTRADICTION:"
		(at 379.73 290.83 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "9ad93ee3-c7cc-4582-8d9b-17737773b500")
	)
	(text "  - The 1k pull-up sources from +5V, whose return is DGND. So the SHELL net picks"
		(at 379.73 295.90999999999997 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "41bd6804-ba18-424e-87ee-a4d28eeda05d")
	)
	(text "    where 4.2 mA of switching current flows on every camera frame. On AGND it"
		(at 379.73 300.99 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "e3f88560-34d2-4013-b796-02170ada741a")
	)
	(text "    would cross NT1, the board's single AGND/DGND star tie. On DGND it never does."
		(at 379.73 306.07 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "41f3da41-72c5-42a3-bc4c-9ac0e9ef55bc")
	)
	(text "    Shells, BAT54S clamps and the 10k/10k threshold divider are therefore all DGND."
		(at 379.73 311.15 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "81072419-5d10-466f-9445-e2296bbfac9e")
	)
	(text "  - V- stays AGND, like U54. It does not enter the COMPARISON: '+' and '-' are both"
		(at 379.73 316.23 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "55314461-f729-416c-815b-45a1fa309fae")
	)
	(text "    DGND-referenced, so an AGND-DGND offset is common-mode and cancels. What V-"
		(at 379.73 321.31 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "08898d97-eb86-4437-ad33-7b2713611c71")
	)
	(text "    sets is the OUTPUT LOW (it is the common emitter): AGND + V_CEsat ~ 0.2 V, read"
		(at 379.73 326.39 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "843eb932-8650-439c-8828-2d38d9b4f6e8")
	)
	(text "    against DGND at a ~0.99 V V_IL. Identical to PD1_COMP/PD2_COMP/ACC_TRIG."
		(at 379.73 331.47 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "3ad675bd-fe6c-4b3e-938f-e52a119544a0")
	)
	(text "The DAC note (VSS = AGND 'NOT DGND') is the SAME principle -- keep the threshold in"
		(at 379.73 336.54999999999995 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "6010891c-0af7-407a-9c56-f2ff3b391b8d")
	)
	(text "the signal's own domain -- reaching the other net because these signals arrive in"
		(at 379.73 341.63 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "93964600-4add-4d76-b06f-3034dc662a62")
	)
	(text "the other domain. It is not being contradicted here."
		(at 379.73 346.71 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "e847b486-b9bf-453f-8e98-a94bddc1d2b6")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 379.73 351.78999999999996 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "0bbfa5c6-2d7a-4f80-97d2-d1fe19224e43")
	)
	(text "MARGINS: 1.63 V low (0.87 V vs 2.50 V) and 2.50 V high (5.00 V vs 2.50 V). The"
		(at 379.73 356.87 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "8db67c84-1386-4b4e-877f-b46479f566d7")
	)
	(text "threshold needs no trimming and gets no DAC channel: the swing is 0.87-5.0 V, so"
		(at 379.73 361.95 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "f4b9d701-312a-4897-b35f-94a8b5be292c")
	)
	(text "anything from ~1.5 to ~3.5 V behaves identically, and all four MCP4728 channels are"
		(at 379.73 367.03 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "f2a2d0a0-a775-4492-b004-f5f897a249d2")
	)
	(text "allocated anyway. Its only effect is a constant sub-us offset on a 2 ms frame."
		(at 379.73 372.11 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "b996fe52-7dbb-4d62-9ab5-05c286a001aa")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 379.73 377.19 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "123b2f4e-dff9-4997-b684-9511c105cb98")
	)
	(text "SOFTWARE MUST TIMESTAMP THE FALLING EDGE. ExposureActive asserts by pulling low and"
		(at 379.73 382.27 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "52c0a374-c029-4c86-9d9e-0d9e6602aa34")
	)
	(text "that edge is actively driven by the opto transistor. The RISING edge is RC through"
		(at 379.73 387.35 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "17c2f855-2247-4c92-8e62-4eac7c27d9f1")
	)
	(text "the pull-up and varies with cable length, so pulse WIDTH measured off this signal"
		(at 379.73 392.42999999999995 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "31df445e-e35a-418a-8ad6-024a0a1f8cb8")
	)
	(text "carries a systematic error."
		(at 379.73 397.51 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "ea6d185f-667b-44bb-be03-a608a9db4f00")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 379.73 402.59 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "0392a7fa-aefc-435e-9e2c-f5238b5a1a69")
	)
	(text "CONNECTORS: spare ports J17B (pi-interface) and J6B (taskpc-digital), the only two"
		(at 379.73 407.66999999999996 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "982e2a3a-b8d4-4ed8-a9d3-741ce9d1e0e9")
	)
	(text "spare ports on the BACK face; their panel holes are already machined. Those sheets"
		(at 379.73 412.75 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "1985a0aa-243a-4c30-9344-b4a2fdb12948")
	)
	(text "wire centre and shell. THE 100R AND CLAMP ARE DRAWN HERE BUT MUST BE PLACED AT THE"
		(at 379.73 417.83 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "aedb6a1f-32ee-4cd2-a527-bc5d35792f73")
	)
	(text "CONNECTOR IN LAYOUT -- protection between panel and silicon has to be true in"
		(at 379.73 422.90999999999997 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "fd3595bb-ebaa-44a8-b813-da9eb836752e")
	)
	(text "copper, not only on a schematic sheet."
		(at 379.73 427.99 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "23174511-4be4-4f82-835c-e0227cbfa619")
	)
	(text ""
		(at 379.73 433.07 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "e5ac6896-d177-4b8b-9161-d50606be3056")
	)
	(text "U76's other two sections are unused: inputs tied ('+' to AGND -- this part's own"
		(at 379.73 438.15 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "091e5b45-e1ac-4faf-b4bb-2fadf8b3b48c")
	)
	(text "V-, and NOT DGND, which would make U76 a SECOND AGND/DGND bridge alongside NT1 and"
		(at 379.73 443.23 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "a0807f15-f1ae-469c-bd08-c94f2b6a447e")
	)
	(text "break the board's single-point ground; '-' to the 2.50 V threshold) so nothing"
		(at 379.73 448.31 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "286558a1-f553-49b0-8ef4-f96921a24bd0")
	)
	(text "floats, outputs no_connect with no pull-up, so they sink nothing. U76 therefore"
		(at 379.73 453.39 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "ed427130-0c93-40c1-b19b-f681cdf939a2")
	)
	(text "sits wholly in the AGND domain; only its passives touch DGND. Refdes here are minted"
		(at 379.73 458.46999999999997 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "a56cf1f5-9623-4ea8-b0cc-7be505a0d8c6")
	)
	(text "OUT OF BAND (U76/D45-D46/R209-R220/C159-C160), above the board-wide maxima, for the"
		(at 379.73 463.55 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)))
		(uuid "0e06f143-f9bf-47a5-8be8-ad51a3adb151")
	)
	(text "same reason R190 is -- see CHANNEL4_SERIES_REF."
